5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We really need a new system. I hate feeling guilty every time I turn on the heater.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The current split is outdated. We need to see the actual costs over a full year first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,It takes way too long to figure out who owes what. I want a system that is fast.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. We are five people now, not three. We need to know if some of us are carrying others.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I just want us to stop arguing about money. It's making the atmosphere in the house very tense.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, what specifically do we need to look at to make it feel fair for everyone?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,The total yearly fluctuations and any upfront costs for changing the hardware.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to know how other houses handle the paperwork. Is there a simpler way?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,We should check if the actual electricity usage varies wildly between our rooms.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I think we should look at our own payment history to see where the friction is.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm worried about the ""vibe"" of the house. Let's see if people are actually suffering in the cold.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
