35,2,1,talk,Mio,,I found out some people literally sweated it out in July to avoid arguments. That's awful!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The bills are wildly inconsistent. February was nearly three times higher than August.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I looked at other methods, but they all seem to take forever. Logging readings is a chore.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,It's worse than we thought. One room uses four times more power than another.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Our payment log shows people are paying weeks late because they're confused by the amounts.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, if the usage is that different, maybe we should pay for what we actually use?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"That sounds fair, but the electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room. That's too expensive upfront.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, if we do individual meters, someone still has to spend forty minutes a month logging them.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"True, but the current ""equal split"" is mathematically unfair given the usage gap I found.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,But adding more complexity to the billing might just lead to more late payments and resentment.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,Some rooms get no sun and need heat earlier. It's not even the residents' fault.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"We can't afford a massive installation fee, but we can't ignore the winter spikes either.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,A template for reconciliation didn't help; it still requires keying in every single invoice.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Misaki, if we don't fix the unfairness, the resentment will just change shape.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'd rather have a slightly unfair system that everyone accepts than a ""perfect"" one that causes fights.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
