60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I like Option A. If we have a fixed seasonal rate, I can use the heater without anxiety.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is stable. It avoids the upfront cost of meters and smooths out those huge winter spikes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option C is the fastest. Just divide by five and be done with it. No templates needed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option C is lazy. Option B is the only one that is actually fair based on the monitor readings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option C is the least likely to cause arguments. It's simple and transparent.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, Option B is too expensive and makes the house feel like a business, not a home.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, 170,000 yen for meters is a non-starter for me right now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, I agree. Option C means the person in charge spends seconds, not hours, on bills.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, but the person using the most power gets a free ride. That's not rational.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shunichi, is ""rationality"" worth the social tension of tracking every watt?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,Option A feels like a good middle ground. We get predictability and no one freezes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It prevents the ""second rent"" feeling in winter. I'm voting for A.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm torn, but Option C is the most efficient for the person doing the work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If B is too expensive, I can't support C. A is at least a structured approach.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll stick with C. Simplicity is the only way to stop the accusations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'm voting A.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,A.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
